age link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: .05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-72ac7faf7c3dc7c6END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-9291f8fc64b33379END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_PLA_ZhentShipment_NinefingersOrders</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_PLA_ZhentShipment_NinefingersOrders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_PLA_ZhentShipment_NinefingersOrders\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">14ed5f04-c524-41a1-976e-4a857b326e6a</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:14ed5f04-c524-41a1-976e-4a857b326e6a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:14ed5f04-c524-41a1-976e-4a857b326e6a\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amnos\" title=\"Amnos\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Portrait_Amnos.png/25px-Portrait_Amnos.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Portrait_Amnos.png/38px-Portrait_Amnos.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Portrait_Amnos.png/50px-Portrait_Amnos.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Amnos\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Portrait_Amnos.png/25px-Portrait_Amnos.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Portrait_Amnos.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Amnos\" title=\"Amnos\">Amnos</a> - dead caravan agent at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Risen_Road\" title=\"The Risen Road\">The Risen Road</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;25&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;527</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Deliver the <a href=\"/wiki/Caravan_Strongbox\" title=\"Caravan Strongbox\">chest</a> to me unopened.\n</p><p><br>\nRead the first sentence again.\n</p><p><br>\nOpen it, and I will know, because you will be dead. This is not a threat. This is what will happen if you open the chest.\n</p><p><br>\nNF\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p><b>Shipment Orders</b> contain instructions regarding a chest that can be looted from the <a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim\" title=\"Zhentarim\">Zhentarim</a> and given to <a href=\"/wiki/Nine-Fingers_Keene\" title=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\">Nine-Fingers Keene</a><sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"can it be given to nine f...\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup>. Reading the note advances the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_Missing_Shipment\" title=\"Find the Missing Shipment\">Find the Missing Shipment</a>. The warning in the note is real; opening the chest begins a potentially difficult encounter.\n</p>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715004645\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1989/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34108/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9149/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 995488/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.524      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   47.524      1 -total\n 51.14%   24.304      8 Template:Icon_text\n 45.44%   21.593     21 Template:Trim\n 19.33%    9.187      2 Template:Uid\n 14.19%    6.745      3 Template:Icon_link\n 13.25%    6.297      1 Template:Main_only\n 1